{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "JOB",
  "chapter": 32,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So these three men ceased to answer Job, because he was righteous in his own eyes.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then was kindled the wrath of Elihu the son of Barachel the Buzite, of the family of Ram: against Job was his wrath kindled, because he justified himself rather than God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Also against his three friends was his wrath kindled, because they had found no answer, and yet had condemned Job.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now Elihu had waited to speak unto Job, because they were elder than he.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And when Elihu saw that there was no answer in the mouth of these three men, his wrath was kindled.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Elihu the son of Barachel the Buzite answered and said,\nI am young, and ye are very old;\nWherefore I held back, and durst not show you mine opinion.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I said, Days should speak,\nAnd multitude of years should teach wisdom.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But there is a spirit in man,\nAnd the breath of the Almighty giveth them understanding.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "It is not the great that are wise,\nNor the aged that understand justice.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore I said, Hearken to me;\nI also will show mine opinion.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, I waited for your words,\nI listened for your reasonings,\nWhilst ye searched out what to say.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yea, I attended unto you,\nAnd, behold, there was none that convinced Job,\nOr that answered his words, among you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Beware lest ye say, We have found wisdom;\nGod may vanquish him, not man:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he hath not directed his words against me;\nNeither will I answer him with your speeches.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They are amazed, they answer no more:\nThey have not a word to say.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And shall I wait, because they speak not,\nBecause they stand still, and answer no more?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I also will answer my part,\nI also will show mine opinion.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I am full of words;\nThe spirit within me constraineth me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, my breast is as wine which hath no vent;\nLike new wine-skins it is ready to burst.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will speak, that I may be refreshed;\nI will open my lips and answer.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let me not, I pray you, respect any man’s person;\nNeither will I give flattering titles unto any man.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOB.32.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:JOB.32.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I know not to give flattering titles;",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Else",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " would my Maker soon take me away.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
